                                                "sense_id": "93b72027-bb34-3e0f-a425-fed7cca2b5b6",
                                                "text": "“Every time it’s shown, I get e-mail from young guys who want to get it on with me,” she said. “Which is wonderful. I’m seventy-seven fucking years old.”"
